  "description": "Find the largest integer that occurs only once in the array. If no such number exists, return -1.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. countMap = new Map();\n2. for (num of nums) countMap.set(num, (countMap.get(num) || 0) + 1);\n3. maxUnique = -1;\n4. for (const [num, count] of countMap) {\n5.   if (count === 1 && num > maxUnique) maxUnique = num;\n6. }\n7. return maxUnique;",
